      "description": "The harness side of this IG's translations. The catalogues themselves stay where smart-base's injector reads them, one per locale per source directory: input/pagecontent/, input/images/ and input/images-source/translations/<locale>.po, from the .pot templates smart-base's extract_translations.py writes beside them (`catalogues` names that pattern). This directory holds what the harness keeps per layer: glossary-sense.json, the adjudicator's sense verdicts for translation:glossary:check. Agent translations are unofficial until a person signs them off; FHIR terms use CodeSystem supplements in input/fsh/translations/<locale>.fsh.",
